@startuml
!theme vibrant
autonumber
hide footbox

actor "User" as User
participant "Angular (Client)" as Client
participant "Nginx Gateway" as Nginx
participant "Backend (Node A)" as Backend
participant "Oracle DB" as DB
participant "Redis" as Redis

== Phase 1: Tab Active (Mở App / Chuyển Tab) ==
User -> Client: Mở Tab (Active)
activate Client

Client -> Client: check `!document.hidden`
Client -> Client: Lấy `lastEventId` từ LocalStorage

Client -> Nginx: GET /stream/USER_01?lastEventId=100
note right: Header: Cache-Control: no-cache

Nginx -> Backend: Proxy Request
activate Backend

Backend -> Backend: Tạo SseEmitter (Timeout 5p)
Backend -> Backend: localEmitters.put("USER_01", emitter)
Backend -> Redis: HSET "user_locations" "USER_01" "NODE_A"
note right: Đánh dấu User đang ở Node A

Backend --> Client: HTTP 200 OK (EventStream)
Client -> Client: resetWatchdog() (Hẹn giờ 45s)

group Sync Data (Lấy bù tin nhắn lỡ)
    Backend -> DB: SELECT * FROM Noti WHERE ID > 100
    DB --> Backend: List [Noti_101, Noti_102]
    loop Từng thông báo
        Backend -> Client: SSE Event: NEW_NOTIFICATION
        Client -> Client: Update UI & LocalStorage
    end
end

group Heartbeat Loop (Server còn sống)
    loop Every 30s [Scheduled]
        Backend -> Client: SSE Event: ping
        Client -> Client: resetWatchdog() (Reset về 0)
    end
end

== Phase 2: Tab Ẩn (Tiết kiệm tài nguyên) ==
User -> Client: Chuyển sang Tab khác / Minimize
Client -> Client: onVisibilityChange(hidden)

Client -> Client: disconnect()
note right: 1. Close EventSource\n2. Clear Watchdog
Client -x Nginx: Đóng kết nối TCP

Backend -> Backend: onCompletion()
Backend -> Redis: HDEL "user_locations" "USER_01"
note right: Xóa vị trí khỏi Redis
deactivate Backend

== Phase 3: Watchdog (Tự phục hồi khi Server chết) ==
User -> Client: Quay lại Tab (Active)
Client -> Nginx: Reconnect... (Vào lại Phase 1)
activate Backend

... Kết nối đang chạy ...
Backend -x Client: (Node A bị Crash / Mất mạng)
note right of Backend: Không gửi được ping

Client -> Client: Watchdog đếm ngược... 30s... 40s...
Client -> Client: 45s Timeout! (Server chết)

Client -> Client: Force Reconnect()
Client -> Nginx: GET /stream/USER_01...
note right: Nginx tự điều hướng sang Node B (Sống)

@enduml